1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,988
Analysts, journalists and compliance teams still answer questions from government data by hand:

2
00:00:06,038 --> 00:00:12,955
digging through FDA, NHTSA and federal spending sites, then copying numbers they can't easily prove.

3
00:00:13,005 --> 00:00:17,135
And AI chatbots make it worse, because they guess.

4
00:00:17,185 --> 00:00:23,572
Research with Receipts is a sandboxed records agent running on Vultr Serverless Inference with DeepSeek.

5
00:00:23,622 --> 00:00:26,576
You ask a question in plain English.

6
00:00:26,626 --> 00:00:32,583
The model writes a small Python program, and that program runs in a throwaway

7
00:00:32,633 --> 00:00:36,016
sandbox that can only reach official public-data APIs.

8
00:00:36,066 --> 00:00:41,072
Which vehicle makes had the most NHTSA recalls in 2025?

9
00:00:41,122 --> 00:00:43,095
In about eight seconds:

10
00:00:43,145 --> 00:00:50,173
Ford, with 146 recall campaigns covering nearly thirteen million vehicles, more than triple Chrysler

11
00:00:50,223 --> 00:00:51,690
in second place.

12
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:53,328
Every number has a receipt.

13
00:00:53,378 --> 00:00:57,912
On the right is the exact API request the sandbox made, and the code

14
00:00:57,962 --> 00:00:58,895
the model wrote.

15
00:00:58,945 --> 00:01:01,187
Click it and check the answer yourself.

16
00:01:01,237 --> 00:01:04,931
Top federal contractors for NAICS 541512 last fiscal year?

17
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:10,753
Accenture Federal leads with about three billion dollars, then General Dynamics IT and Oracle

18
00:01:10,803 --> 00:01:13,249
Health, straight from USAspending dot gov.

19
00:01:13,299 --> 00:01:16,627
Recent FDA food recalls for undeclared allergens:

20
00:01:16,677 --> 00:01:23,864
a table of recall numbers, products, allergens and hazard class, every row taken from openFDA.

21
00:01:23,914 --> 00:01:25,552
Now the safety test.

22
00:01:25,602 --> 00:01:31,458
We ask the agent to go fetch company websites that aren't on the allowlist.

23
00:01:31,508 --> 00:01:33,568
The sandbox refuses every one.

24
00:01:33,618 --> 00:01:39,474
Each attempt is blocked and logged, while the legitimate FDA data still comes back

25
00:01:39,524 --> 00:01:40,740
with its receipt.

26
00:01:40,790 --> 00:01:47,919
No secrets in the sandbox, no open internet, a fresh environment for every task, destroyed afterward.

27
00:01:47,969 --> 00:01:49,265
Research with Receipts:

28
00:01:49,315 --> 00:01:53,752
answers you can verify, from an agent you can contain.

29
00:01:53,802 --> 00:01:55,098
Built on Vultr.
